"""`pyfun lsp` navigation in one document, per kind of symbol site.

One rich document (measures, sum and record types, externs, active patterns, a nested
module, CE binders, pattern binders, mutable cells, stdlib members, operators,
literals and doc comments); each case opens it and sends one request kind at one
site: hover, definition, references with and without the declaration, or
prepareRename followed by a valid and a wrong-case rename.

Generated by add/pfedge/tools/gen_lsp_nav.py (fixed seed); expected transcripts and written
files were captured from the reference binary.
"""

import pytest

import hard_edge_support as S

